Z||000000||hefty||10-09-1999||11:45 PM||||Need help, how do you set the time on an '87 GT factory AM /FM casset ? I recently purchesed it and love it. Have been thinking about uping HP to around 300. Should I even consider the 2.8 or just go with the 3.4 ? how would the manual trans. hold up ?||||reg||8
Z||000001||fiero56||10-09-1999||11:52 PM||||To set the clock, I believe you have to turn the radio off, push the set button, then use the seek button for the hour, and the scan button for the minutes.  It's been a while since I set mine, but I'm pretty sure that's the procedure.||||reg||1
